sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor C as Cashier
participant POS as PosScreen
participant TD as CashTenderDialog
participant Cart as CartViewModel
participant SR as SaleRepositoryImpl
participant DS as SaleLocalDataSource
participant DB as SQLite
participant Inv as InventoryViewModel
participant Ses as SessionViewModel

C->>POS: tap item tiles
POS->>Cart: addItem(item)
Note right of Cart: capped at qtyOnHand
C->>POS: choose payment method
alt method == Cash
  POS->>TD: showCashTenderDialog(total)
  C->>TD: enter / tap amount received
  TD->>TD: coversTotal(), changeDue()
  TD-->>POS: amountTendered
end
POS->>Cart: checkout(method, amountTendered)
Cart->>Cart: build Sale + SaleLineItems
Cart->>SR: recordSale(sale)
SR->>DS: recordSale(SaleModel)
activate DS
DS->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
DS->>DB: INSERT sales
loop each line item
  DS->>DB: SELECT unitCost FROM items
  DS->>DB: INSERT sale_line_items (with unitCost)
  DS->>DB: UPDATE items SET qtyOnHand -= qty
end
DS->>DB: COMMIT
deactivate DS
Cart->>Cart: clear()
Cart-->>POS: true
par refresh
  POS->>Inv: load()
and
  POS->>Ses: log("Sale ₱… · items · method")
  Ses->>DB: INSERT audit_log
end
POS-->>C: "Sold" banner + change breakdown
